  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation in a multimodal setup using scvi_n200 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, and weighted fusion, directly comparing it to avgpool aggregation (from config_031). Validation accuracy improved to 0.7131 (vs 0.6776 in config_006), suggesting transformer aggregation may offer performance benefits. However, the relative impact of aggregation method versus other components remains uncertain due to limited direct comparisons with alternative strategies."
}

